<title>ITALY: Gross yield rises at Italy 18-mo CTZ bill auction.</title>
<headline>Gross yield rises at Italy 18-mo CTZ bill auction.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for the 4.0 trillion lire auction of a seventh tranche of March 15, 1999 two-year Italian Treasury zero coupon certificates (CTZ) and 2.5 trillion lire auction of a third tranche of 18-month October 15, 1998 CTZs.</p>
<p>		    Oct 15, 98  Pvs    Mar 15, 99  Pvs</p>
<p>Net Yield	 5.93 pct    5.92   6.02 pct    6.01</p>
<p>Gross Yield     6.77	  6.76   6.84	  6.84</p>
<p>Assigned price 90.85	 90.65  88.30	 88.10</p>
<p>Bids	     5.519 trillion lire  7.839 trillion lire</p>
<p>Assigned	 2.500 trillion lire  4.000 trillion lire</p>
<p>Note - Results compare with previous auctions of CTZs on April 10.</p>
</text>
